[{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q1","number":1,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\cosech x=\\frac{2e^x}{e^{2x}-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>By using the substitution <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\cosech x\\,dx=-2\\artanh(e^x)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=1/\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=(e^x-e^{-x})/2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech x=\\frac{2}{e^x-e^{-x}}=\\frac{2e^x}{e^{2x}-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dx=du/u\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Then</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\cosech x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{2}{u^2-1}\\,du=-2\\int\\frac{1}{1-u^2}\\,du=-2\\artanh u+c=-2\\artanh(e^x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q2","number":2,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sech x=\\frac{2e^x}{e^{2x}+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>By using the substitution <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\sech x\\,dx=2\\arctan(e^x)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech x=\\frac{1}{\\cosh x}=\\frac{2}{e^x+e^{-x}}=\\frac{2e^x}{e^{2x}+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dx=du/u\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\sech x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{2}{u^2+1}\\,du=2\\arctan u+c=2\\arctan(e^x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>The shaded region shown in the diagram below is enclosed between the graphs of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=12\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=24-9\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the exact shaded area in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\ln(7+4\\sqrt3)+q\\sqrt3+r\\pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.30/questions/assets/diagrams/q3-230.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p>First find where the curves intersect. Put <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n12\\sech x=24-9\\cosh x\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\frac4C=8-3C\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad 3C^2-8C+4=0\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad (3C-2)(C-2)=0.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all real <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\\ne2/3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\pm\\ln(2+\\sqrt{2^2-1})=\\pm\\ln(2+\\sqrt3),\n\\qquad -\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)=\\ln(2-\\sqrt3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Now integrate between these limits:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI =\\int_{\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)}^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}(24-9\\cosh x)\\,dx\n-\\int_{\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)}^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}12\\sech x\\,dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\int_{\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)}^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}(24-9\\cosh x-12\\sech x)\\,dx.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As in Question 2, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int\\sech x\\,dx=2\\arctan(e^x)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI=\\left[24x-9\\sinh x-24\\arctan(e^x)\\right]_{\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)}^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Evaluating the limits as in the printed working,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI={} \\left(24\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)-\\frac92\\left(e^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}-e^{-\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}\\right)-24\\cdot\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n -\\left(24\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)-\\frac92\\left(e^{\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)}-e^{-\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)}\\right)-24\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n={} \\left(24\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)-\\frac92\\left((2+\\sqrt3)-(2-\\sqrt3)\\right)-20\\pi\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n -\\left(24\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)-\\frac92\\left((2-\\sqrt3)-(2+\\sqrt3)\\right)-2\\pi\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n={} \\left(24\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)-9\\sqrt3-10\\pi\\right)\n-\\left(24\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)+9\\sqrt3-2\\pi\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n={} 24\\ln\\left(\\frac{2+\\sqrt3}{2-\\sqrt3}\\right)-18\\sqrt3-8\\pi\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n={} 24\\ln(7+4\\sqrt3)-18\\sqrt3-8\\pi.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Find:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\tanh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\coth x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\tanh x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{\\sinh x}{\\cosh x}\\,dx=\\ln|\\cosh x|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\coth x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{\\cosh x}{\\sinh x}\\,dx=\\ln|\\sinh x|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Find:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\cosech x\\coth x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\sech x\\tanh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\cosech x\\coth x\\,dx =\\int\\cosh x(\\sinh x)^{-2}\\,dx=-(\\sinh x)^{-1}+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\cosech x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternatively, writing in exponentials and using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x-e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{2e^x+2e^{-x}}{(e^x-e^{-x})^2}\\,dx=\\int\\frac{2}{u^2}\\,du=-\\frac2u+c=-\\cosech x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\sech x\\tanh x\\,dx =\\int\\sinh x(\\cosh x)^{-2}\\,dx=-(\\cosh x)^{-1}+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\sech x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternatively, using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x+e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the exponential form gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int 2u^{-2}\\,du=-2/u+c=-\\sech x+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q6","number":6,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By expressing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in terms of exponentials, prove that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh^2x-\\sinh^2x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\cosech^2x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosh^2x-\\sinh^2x=\\left(\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}2\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2\\right)^2\n=\\frac{e^{2x}+2+e^{-2x}-e^{2x}+2-e^{-2x}}4=1.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh^2x-\\sinh^2x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\cosech^2x\\,dx =\\int\\frac{\\cosh^2x-\\sinh^2x}{\\sinh^2x}\\,dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\int\\frac{\\sinh x\\,d(\\cosh x)-\\cosh x\\,d(\\sinh x)}{\\sinh^2x}=-\\coth x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternatively, writing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and substituting <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=u^2-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\left(\\frac{2}{e^x-e^{-x}}\\right)^2dx=\\int\\frac{4u}{(u^2-1)^2}\\,du=-\\frac{2}{u^2-1}+c=-\\coth x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Find the equation of the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> given that its gradient function is:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\cosech 3x\\coth 3x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{dy}{dx}=3\\cosech^2\\left(\\frac{x}{9}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{dy}{dx}=6\\sech 9x\\tanh 9x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{dy}{dx}=10\\coth 2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=\\int\\cosech 3x\\coth 3x\\,dx=-\\frac13\\cosech 3x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=3\\int\\cosech^2(x/9)\\,dx=-27\\coth(x/9)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=6\\int\\sech 9x\\tanh 9x\\,dx=-\\frac23\\sech 9x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=10\\int\\coth 2x\\,dx=5\\ln|\\sinh 2x|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\cosh x}{\\sinh^2x+1}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"du=\\cosh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Then</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{\\cosh x}{\\sinh^2x+1}\\,dx=\\int\\frac{1}{u^2+1}\\,du=\\arctan(\\sinh x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sqrt{\\sin^2x+1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\sin x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"du=\\cos x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sqrt{\\sin^2x+1}}\\,dx=\\int\\frac{du}{\\sqrt{u^2+1}}=\\arsinh u+c=\\arsinh(\\sin x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q10","number":10,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\cosh^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{du}{dx}=\\sinh 2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\sinh 2x}{\\cosh^4x+1}\\,dx=\\arctan(\\cosh^2x)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{du}{dx}=2\\cosh x\\sinh x=\\sinh 2x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>With <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\cosh^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"du=\\sinh2x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{\\sinh2x}{\\cosh^4x+1}\\,dx=\\int\\frac{du}{u^2+1}=\\arctan u+c=\\arctan(\\cosh^2x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Use integration by parts to find:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\arsinh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\arcosh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\artanh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Integration by parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\arsinh x\\,dx=x\\arsinh x-\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,dx=x\\arsinh x-\\sqrt{x^2+1}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Integration by parts gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\arcosh x\\,dx=x\\arcosh x-\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\,dx=x\\arcosh x-\\sqrt{x^2-1}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Integration by parts gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int\\artanh x\\,dx=x\\artanh x-\\int\\frac{x}{1-x^2}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. With <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=1-x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{x}{1-x^2}\\,dx=-\\frac12\\ln|1-x^2|,\n\\qquad\\int\\artanh x\\,dx=x\\artanh x+\\frac12\\ln|1-x^2|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_0^{1/3}6\\artanh x\\,dx=\\ln\\left(\\frac{2^p}{3^q}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are positive integers.</p>","steps":["<p>Integration by parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=6\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int 6\\artanh x\\,dx=6x\\artanh x+3\\ln|1-x^2|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_0^{1/3}6\\artanh x\\,dx\n =\\left[3x\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\\right)+3\\ln|1-x^2|\\right]_0^{1/3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln2+3\\ln\\left(\\frac89\\right)=\\ln2+\\ln\\left(\\frac{2^9}{3^6}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{2^{10}}{3^6}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\frac{\\tanh 4}{2}}4\\artanh(2x)\\,dx=8\\tanh 4+\\ln|1-\\tanh^2 4|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Integration by parts, with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\artanh(2x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=4\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int4\\artanh(2x)\\,dx=4x\\artanh(2x)+\\ln|1-4x^2|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_0^{\\tanh4/2}4\\artanh(2x)\\,dx\n =\\left[2x\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+2x}{1-2x}\\right)+\\ln|1-4x^2|\\right]_0^{\\tanh4/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\tanh4\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\tanh4}{1-\\tanh4}\\right)+\\ln|1-\\tanh^24|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =8\\tanh4+\\ln|1-\\tanh^24|.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q14","number":14,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{d}{dx}(x\\arcosh 3x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\arcosh 3x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d}{dx}(x\\arcosh3x)=\\arcosh3x+\\frac{3x}{\\sqrt{9x^2-1}}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Using part a) and integration by parts,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\arcosh3x\\,dx\n =x\\arcosh3x-\\int\\frac{3x}{\\sqrt{9x^2-1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =x\\arcosh3x-\\frac13\\sqrt{9x^2-1}+c,\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>where the remaining integral follows from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=9x^2-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int x^2\\arcosh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Integration by parts, with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=x^2\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int x^2\\arcosh x\\,dx=\\frac13x^3\\arcosh x-\\frac13\\int\\frac{x^3}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\,dx.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Put <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=x^2-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2=u+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"du=2x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Then</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{x^3}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\,dx=\\frac12\\int(u+1)u^{-1/2}\\,du=\\frac13u^{3/2}+u^{1/2}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int x^2\\arcosh x\\,dx=\\frac13x^3\\arcosh x-\\frac19(x^2-1)^{3/2}-\\frac13\\sqrt{x^2-1}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q16","number":16,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2}=A+\\frac{B}{1-x^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int4x\\artanh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2}=\\frac{2x^2-2+2}{1-x^2}=-2+\\frac{2}{1-x^2},\n\\qquad A=-2,\\quad B=2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>By parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=4x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int4x\\artanh x\\,dx =2x^2\\artanh x-\\int\\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2}\\,dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =2x^2\\artanh x-\\int\\left(-2+\\frac{2}{1-x^2}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =2x^2\\artanh x+2x-2\\artanh x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>Find:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\arsinh x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\arcosh x}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\artanh x}{1-x^2}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Taking <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=dx/\\sqrt{x^2+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI=(\\arsinh x)^2-I,\\qquad I=\\frac12(\\arsinh x)^2+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Similarly, with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=dx/\\sqrt{x^2-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI=(\\arcosh x)^2-I,\\qquad I=\\frac12(\\arcosh x)^2+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>With <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=dx/(1-x^2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nI=(\\artanh x)^2-I,\\qquad I=\\frac12(\\artanh x)^2+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>Find the exact value of the following integral in terms of logarithms:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_0^2\\frac{\\arsinh 2x}{\\sqrt{4x^2+1}}\\,dx.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>Integration by parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arsinh2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=dx/\\sqrt{4x^2+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=\\tfrac12\\arsinh2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, yields</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{\\arsinh2x}{\\sqrt{4x^2+1}}\\,dx=\\frac14(\\arsinh2x)^2+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_0^2\\frac{\\arsinh2x}{\\sqrt{4x^2+1}}\\,dx=\\frac14(\\arsinh4)^2=\\frac14\\left(\\ln(4+\\sqrt{17})\\right)^2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>Find the exact value of the following integral in terms of logarithms:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{1/3}^{4}\\frac{\\arcosh 3x}{\\sqrt{9x^2-1}}\\,dx.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>Integration by parts gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{\\arcosh3x}{\\sqrt{9x^2-1}}\\,dx=\\frac16(\\arcosh3x)^2+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Consequently,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{1/3}^4\\frac{\\arcosh3x}{\\sqrt{9x^2-1}}\\,dx=\\frac16(\\arcosh12)^2=\\frac16\\left(\\ln(12+\\sqrt{143})\\right)^2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q20","number":20,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{10}{5\\cosh x-4\\sinh x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> can be written in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{pe^x}{e^{2x}+q}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers.</p></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\ln 3}\\frac{30}{5\\cosh x-4\\sinh x}\\,dx=5\\pi-20\\arctan\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{10}{5\\cosh x-4\\sinh x}\n=\\frac{10}{\\frac52(e^x+e^{-x})-2(e^x-e^{-x})}\n=\\frac{20}{e^x+9e^{-x}}=\\frac{20e^x}{e^{2x}+9}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=20\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the limits <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> become <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_0^{\\ln3}\\frac{30}{5\\cosh x-4\\sinh x}\\,dx\n=\\int_1^3\\frac{60}{u^2+9}\\,du\n=\\left[20\\arctan\\left(\\frac{u}{3}\\right)\\right]_1^3\n=5\\pi-20\\arctan\\frac13.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q21","number":21,"question":"<p>Use the substitution <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{1}{(1-x^2)((\\artanh x)^2+1)}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Put <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"du=dx/(1-x^2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{1}{(1-x^2)((\\artanh x)^2+1)}\\,dx\n=\\int\\frac{1}{u^2+1}\\,du=\\arctan(\\artanh x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q22","number":22,"question":"<p>A curve has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle y=\\arcosh\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}4\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\geq\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{dy}{dx}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and write it in a simplified form.</p></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_{64}^{144}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x(x-16)}}\\,dx=p\\ln\\left(\\frac{q+p\\sqrt p}{p+\\sqrt q}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are positive integers.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{1}{8\\sqrt{x}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x/16-1}}\n=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x(x-16)}}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>From part a), <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\,dy/dx=1/\\sqrt{x(x-16)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{64}^{144}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x(x-16)}}\\,dx\n =2\\left[\\arcosh\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}4\\right)\\right]_{64}^{144}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =2(\\arcosh3-\\arcosh2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =2\\ln\\left(\\frac{3+2\\sqrt2}{2+\\sqrt3}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q23","number":23,"question":"<p>Use integration by parts to find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x\\arsinh x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Integration by parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=x\\,dx/\\sqrt{x^2+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=\\sqrt{x^2+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{x\\arsinh x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,dx\n=\\sqrt{x^2+1}\\,\\arsinh x-\\int1\\,dx\n=\\sqrt{x^2+1}\\,\\arsinh x-x+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q24","number":24,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{d}{dx}(\\arcosh 2x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Use integration by parts to find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x\\arcosh 2x}{\\sqrt{4x^2-1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d}{dx}(\\arcosh2x)=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4x^2-1}}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arcosh2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=x\\,dx/\\sqrt{4x^2-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=\\tfrac14\\sqrt{4x^2-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{x\\arcosh2x}{\\sqrt{4x^2-1}}\\,dx\n=\\frac14\\sqrt{4x^2-1}\\,\\arcosh2x-\\frac14\\int2\\,dx\n=\\frac14\\sqrt{4x^2-1}\\,\\arcosh2x-\\frac{x}{2}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q25","number":25,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By using a double-angle identity, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh(2\\arsinh x)=2x\\sqrt{x^2+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int x\\arsinh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh(2u)=2\\sinh u\\cosh u\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sinh(2\\arsinh x)=2x\\cosh(\\arsinh x)=2x\\sqrt{x^2+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Integration by parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int x\\arsinh x\\,dx =\\frac{x^2}{2}\\arsinh x-\\frac12\\int\\frac{x^2}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{x^2}{2}\\arsinh x-\\frac12\\int\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+1}-\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{x^2-1}{2}\\arsinh x+\\frac{x\\sqrt{x^2+1}}2+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Here <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int\\sqrt{x^2+1}\\,dx=\\tfrac12(x\\sqrt{x^2+1}+\\arsinh x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int dx/\\sqrt{x^2+1}=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q26","number":26,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By writing in exponential form, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\cosech x\\,dx=\\ln\\left|\\tanh\\frac{x}{2}\\right|+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\" type=\"i\"><li><p>By writing in exponential form, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\sech x\\,dx=2\\arctan(e^x)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle e^x=\\frac{1+\\tanh(x/2)}{1-\\tanh(x/2)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\sech x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> can also be written as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle2\\arctan\\left(\\tanh\\frac{x}{2}\\right)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Writing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=2/(e^x-e^{-x})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and setting <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\cosech x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{2}{u^2-1}\\,du\n=\\ln\\left|\\frac{u-1}{u+1}\\right|+c\n=\\ln\\left|\\tanh\\frac{x}{2}\\right|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b i)</h3><p>As in Question 2, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\sech x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{2}{u^2+1}\\,du=2\\arctan(e^x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b ii)</h3><p>Using exponentials,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1+\\tanh\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{2e^{x/2}}{e^{x/2}+e^{-x/2}},\\qquad\n1-\\tanh\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{2e^{-x/2}}{e^{x/2}+e^{-x/2}},\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so their ratio is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Alternatively, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh(x/2)=(e^x-1)/(e^x+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; rearranging gives the same result.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b iii)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=\\tanh(x/2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. From part ii), <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^x=(1+t)/(1-t)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The tangent addition formula gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\arctan t\\right)=\\frac{1+t}{1-t}=e^x,\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\arctan(e^x)=2\\arctan(t)+\\pi/2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\pi/2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is absorbed into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\sech x\\,dx=2\\arctan\\left(\\tanh\\frac{x}{2}\\right)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.30-q27","number":27,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By using exponential form, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{d}{dx}(\\sech x)=-\\sech x\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int x\\sech x\\tanh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Writing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=2/(e^x+e^{-x})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and differentiating,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d}{dx}(\\sech x)=-\\frac{2(e^x-e^{-x})}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\n=-\\sech x\\tanh x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>By parts with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"dv=\\sech x\\tanh x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=-\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int x\\sech x\\tanh x\\,dx\n =-x\\sech x+\\int\\sech x\\,dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-x\\sech x+2\\arctan(e^x)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]